Elena,

Thank you for raising this early; it's much better than finding out in week seven.

You're right that we hold Type I today. Our Type II observation window started April 1 and closes September 30, run by the same auditor. I'd rather tell you that plainly than dress it up.

I'll send you our SOC 2 Type I report and the executive summary of our May penetration test (third-party, no open criticals or highs) by July 24, under NDA. Dana Okafor, copied, is our solutions engineer and will be your technical point of contact for the rest of the review.

